# Google Sheet template naming

When creating or updating Google Sheet workbook generators (Hub or Spoke):

- Always put the **template version** in the Google Sheet **file/project name**
- Spoke: `{Body Shop Name} — Google Ad Management Sheet (V {TEMPLATE_VERSION})`
- Hub: `Built by Shah — Google Ads Hub (V {TEMPLATE_VERSION})`
- Keep `TEMPLATE_VERSION` as a single constant in each generator and bump it when the schema/layout changes
- Do not ship workbook names without a version suffix
